sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Maya / CMP-001
  participant O as CMP-003 Orchestrator
  participant R as CMP-004 Retrieval
  participant G as CMP-005 Tool Gateway
  participant H as CMP-006 Human Review
  participant X as CMP-009 OBS-001
  participant A as CMP-009 AUD-001

  U->>O: request + authenticated session + optional traceparent
  O->>O: validate traceparent; create authoritative run/task/case context
  O->>X: task.started span/event
  O->>A: append task.started
  O->>R: retrieval request + trace context + authenticated scope
  R->>X: retrieval span, source refs, counts, freshness
  R-->>O: cited evidence
  O->>G: proposed protected write + grant + trace context
  G->>A: append tool.write.requested (durable)
  G->>G: AUTH-001 + BR-001 + guardrails
  G->>X: tool span and operational metrics
  G->>A: append tool.write.completed / ambiguous outcome
  G-->>O: typed result
  O->>H: review package + artefact digest
  H->>A: append human.approval.decided
  H->>X: human wait/decision telemetry
  O->>A: append state.transitioned and task.disposed
  O->>X: close trace

  Note over U,A: trace IDs correlate the flow but never replace identity, authorization, approval or tenant checks
